ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This software is a research prototype. It is not a medical device, it has not
been reviewed or cleared by any regulatory body, and it has not undergone
prospective clinical validation. It must not be used to make or defer a
medical decision. See EVALUATION.md for measured performance, including the
positive predictive value at real population prevalence, which is low for
every panel.
